<section class="panel">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="headline">The Fool</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Since childhood I have felt that there was something greater than myself that needed my attention. I cannot quite explain it, but I suppose my mission, in the end, is this:</p>
      <p class="prose__emphasis"><strong><em>To create reflection, and to walk alongside you until you can answer your own questions.</em></strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
